# StudyNexs Engineering Constitution

Repository:
D:\Projects\studynexs-platform\studynexs-dev

Primary Branch:
develop

## Engineering Principles

- Work only in this repository.
- Stay on the current branch.
- Build production-quality software.
- Prefer reusable abstractions over feature-specific implementations.
- Extend existing services before creating new ones.
- Keep the architecture modular, testable, and maintainable.
- Avoid duplicate implementations.
- Treat the implementation as the source of truth.
- Verify existing functionality before introducing new code.
- Never redesign validated architecture unless explicitly instructed.
- Follow existing coding conventions and architectural patterns.
- Keep modules loosely coupled and highly cohesive.

## Documentation

Before starting work, read:

- CLAUDE.md
- docs/PLATFORM_STATUS.md
- docs/AGENT_HANDOVER.md
- docs/STATUS.md
- docs/ROADMAP.md
- docs/DECISION_LOG.md

Treat:

- CLAUDE.md as the engineering constitution.
- PLATFORM_STATUS.md as the engineering dashboard.

Always verify documentation against the implementation before making assumptions.